<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mutations &middot; Autoresearch &middot; GEODE Self-Improving Hub</title>
<meta name="description" content="Autoresearch mutation ledger — apply + attribution records joined by mutation_id. Target, before→after, Δfitness, outcome.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.css">
<script src="/geode/self-improving/assets/hub.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<div class="shell">

  {{ hub_nav }}

  <main class="content" id="main">
    {{ hub_crumbs }}
    <h1 class="page-title">Mutations <span class="bucket autoresearch">autoresearch</span></h1>
    <p class="page-sub">Each mutation the self-improving-loop runner applied, joined by <code>mutation_id</code> from the <code>mutations.jsonl</code> apply record (target &middot; before &rarr; after &middot; rationale) and its attribution record (&Delta;fitness &middot; significance), the latter landing once the post-mutation audit completes. Expand <code>payload</code> for the full change.</p>

{{ mutations_summary }}

    <h2 class="section"><span>Mutations &middot; {{ mutations_section_label }}</span></h2>
    <table class="records">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">applied</th>
          <th scope="col">target</th>
          <th scope="col">aimed dim</th>
          <th scope="col">&Delta; fitness</th>
          <th scope="col" class="num">attribution</th>
          <th scope="col">outcome</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{{ mutations_rows }}
      </tbody>
    </table>

{{ held_out_curve }}

    <div class="build-info">
      <p>Source: <code>autoresearch/state/mutations.jsonl</code> — apply + attribution records joined by <code>mutation_id</code>.</p>
      <p>Published by <code>.github/workflows/pages.yml</code> on every <code>main</code> push.</p>
      <p>Repo: <a href="https://github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode" rel="noopener">github.com/mangowhoiscloud/geode</a></p>
      <p>Harness chip legend:
        <span class="chip payg">PAYG</span>API key billing &middot;
        <span class="chip claude">Legacy Claude CLI</span>historical receipts &middot;
        <span class="chip codex">ChatGPT</span>ChatGPT subscription, Codex CLI OAuth &middot;
        <span class="chip geode">GEODE</span>self-target wrapper.
      </p>
      <p class="version-stamp">
        Rendered against GEODE <code>v{{ geode_version }}</code> &middot; DESIGN.md schema {{ design_schema_version }} &middot; built {{ build_date }}.
        Dim subset: 22 (geode_5axes). Pipeline phases: 8. Baseline schema: v2 (PR-2).
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>
